	(text "v1.0: WRITE LOCK solder jumper JP4 closed -> WLOCK high -> 74LVC1G32 output high -> WGATE released (set once at assembly: the board sits in a closed enclosure, nothing is pluggable later).\nOpen (default, 100k pull-down) -> WGATE follows the MCU. TP7: WDATA (MCU), TP8: WGATE after the gate.\nSelf-test loopback without jumpers: INDEX_SIM (PE5, TIM15_CH1) -> U7F -> FD_INDEX (wired-OR like the sync sensor J19); LOOP_EN (PG14, 100k pull-down) closes U22 TS5A3166 between FD_WDATA and FD_RDATA and Q5 pulls FD_TRK0 low; FD_WGATE is read back through U10F (IEC sheet) as WGATE_SENSE (PG15)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 280 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f9ad1634-ffea-52f7-b3a7-c354af3746ae")
	)
