	(text "A11a (24.10.2026, owner list M1/M4/M6): U14 74LVC1G32 forms LOCK = WLOCK_HW or WLOCK_FW (both high = locked; reset and cable-off states are locked). U30 74LVC2G32 gates the two write requests with LOCK: FDD_WGATE -> FDD_WGATE_G (U7 -> J6/J7 pin 24) and APL_WRREQ -> APL_WRREQ_G (U16 2A2 -> J14 pin 10). Both are active low, LOCK high forces them inactive. Replaces the 3-input OR of A9b; a later Mac port (K1) hangs on the same LOCK.\nM4: the 1k terminations R75-R91 (and R97-R99 on the Amiga sheet) now pull up to FDD_5V, so a drive with its supply off is not back-fed through the bus. M6: JP2 is gone, J6 pin 3 is GND (SA800/TEAC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.09 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c959aefa-07da-4639-93f7-4214b7095757")
	)
